        "Description": "Good afternoon, 47.\r\rYour Destination is the Global Innovation Race in Miami, Usa.\r\rYour Main Target is Maxwell Rutter.\rRutter is a retired racer, that got into a serious car &quot;accident&quot; killing dozens of people.\r\rYour Secondary targets are Kronstadt, Kowoon, Sotteraneo and Thwack Mechanics,That may couse trouble.\r\rEliminate them, so no more &quot;accidents&quot; are happening.\rGood luck, 47.\r(Silent Assasin is possible)",
